{
    "operationName": "devicesAttributesCatalog",
    "query": "query devicesAttributesCatalog ( $accountId:ID! $sortOrderInput:SortOrderInput $deviceAttributeCatalogInput:DeviceAttributeCatalogInput $deviceComplianceCatalogInput:DeviceComplianceCatalogInput $deviceRiskCatalogInput:DeviceRiskCatalogInput) {\n\tdevices ( accountId:$accountId ) {\n\t\tattributesCatalog {\n\t\t\tcategory ( sort:$sortOrderInput   ) {\n\t\t\t\titems\n\t\t\t\tpageInfo {\n\t\t\t\t\ttotal\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\ttype ( input:$deviceAttributeCatalogInput   ) {\n\t\t\t\titems\n\t\t\t\tpageInfo {\n\t\t\t\t\ttotal\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tmodel ( input:$deviceAttributeCatalogInput   ) {\n\t\t\t\titems\n\t\t\t\tpageInfo {\n\t\t\t\t\ttotal\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tmanufacturer ( input:$deviceAttributeCatalogInput   ) {\n\t\t\t\titems\n\t\t\t\tpageInfo {\n\t\t\t\t\ttotal\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tos ( input:$deviceAttributeCatalogInput   ) {\n\t\t\t\titems\n\t\t\t\tpageInfo {\n\t\t\t\t\ttotal\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tcompliance ( input:$deviceComplianceCatalogInput   ) {\n\t\t\t\titems {\n\t\t\t\t\tapplicationConnector {\n\t\t\t\t\t\tid\n\t\t\t\t\t\tname\n\t\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t\tstate\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\tpageInfo {\n\t\t\t\t\ttotal\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\trisk ( input:$deviceRiskCatalogInput   ) {\n\t\t\t\titems {\n\t\t\t\t\tapplicationConnector {\n\t\t\t\t\t\tid\n\t\t\t\t\t\tname\n\t\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t\tlevel {\n\t\t\t\t\t\tid\n\t\t\t\t\t\tmin\n\t\t\t\t\t\tmax\n\t\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\tpageInfo {\n\t\t\t\t\ttotal\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}\n\t}\t\n}",
